WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.396
Hi, I'm Wei-Cheng. Welcome to Rust Programming with RustRover,

00:00:01.592 --> 00:00:04.141
where you'll write fast,

00:00:04.245 --> 00:00:08.405
memory-safe Rust and build a command-line tool.

00:00:08.692 --> 00:00:09.973
And this is Jae-won. He'll teach you enums,

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:13.708
pattern matching and iterators.
